; Modular ERB: OMOGATARI/LORE/NewspaperTips.ERB

@NEWSPAPER_1_INFO
#FUNCTIONS
NEWSPAPER_AD_NAME '= "Alignment Fix"
NEWSPAPER_AD_TYPE '= "Tip"
NEWSPAPER_AD_CANDO = 1

@NEWSPAPER_1
RESETCOLOR
PRINTFORML ───────────────────────────────
FONTBOLD
PRINTDATAL
	DATAFORM  TW나 다른 게임에서 지형이나 등급을 망쳤다면:
ENDDATA
FONTREGULAR
PRINTFORML ───────────────────────────────
SETFONT "ＭＳ Ｐゴシック"
FONTITALIC
PRINTFORML	%BREAKENG("1) Check in Emuera settings (not game's!) on display tab if your Drawing Interface is textRenderer")%
PRINTFORML	%BREAKENG("2) Switch font size to an even value. So if your font size is 15 (odd), try 16 (even). If that doesn't help, keep playing with values, make sure they're even")%
PRINTFORML - 페디
FONTREGULAR
SETFONT
PRINTFORML ───────────────────────────────
RETURN 1

@NEWSPAPER_2_INFO
#FUNCTIONS
NEWSPAPER_AD_NAME '= "Foraging Sales"
NEWSPAPER_AD_TYPE '= "Tip"
NEWSPAPER_AD_CANDO = 1

@NEWSPAPER_2
#DIM nItem
CALL FISHER_YATES_SHAFFLE(999)
FOR LOCAL ,0, 999
nItem = SHAFFLE_ARRAY:(LOCAL)
SELECTCASE nItem
	CASE 601, 603 TO 609, 612 TO 615, 617 TO 620, 622 TO 625, 632 TO 635, 637, 640 TO 643, 646
		SIF ITEMNAME:nItem != ""
			BREAK
ENDSELECT
NEXT
RESETCOLOR
PRINTFORML ───────────────────────────────
FONTBOLD
PRINTDATAL
	DATAFORM  %PLURALIZER(ITEMNAME_TR(nItem))%가 필요하다!
ENDDATA
FONTREGULAR
PRINTFORML ───────────────────────────────
SETFONT "ＭＳ Ｐゴシック"
FONTITALIC
PRINTFORML	저희는 판매 제한 없이 품목당 \\{(ITEMPRICE:(nItem) / 2)}을 지불하겠습니다!
PRINTFORML - %NAME:72%
FONTREGULAR
SETFONT
PRINTFORML ───────────────────────────────
RETURN 1
